---

## ⚙️ Installation

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/FPGA-Image-Enhancement.git

cd FPGA-Image-Enhancement
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## ▶️ Run Inference

```bash
python testing_code/test.py
```

---

## ⚡ FPGA Deployment

The FPGA deployment workflow includes:

- INT8 quantization
- Vitis AI compilation
- `.xmodel` generation
- DPU execution
- FPGA benchmarking

Deployment model:

```bash
models/model_b8_c128_int.xmodel
```

---

## 🐳 Docker Support

Build Docker image:

```bash
docker build -t fpga-enhancement .
```

Run Docker container:

```bash
docker run -it fpga-enhancement
```

